break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⟡.·"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで読んでいただきありがとうございます՞⸝⸝> ₃ <⸝⸝՞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は雨が多いですね(  ･᷅-･᷄ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小雨だったら止むんじゃないかと思って傘を持たずに歩き続けてしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからかな、目的地に着く頃にはびっしょびしょになってることがよくあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前はグレーの服が雨で水玉柄になりました(  ･᷅-･᷄ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと基本、歩く時は前しか見てねぇ☆なのでよく水たまりに落ちます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長靴買うべきかな(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"要検討ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまた　！"}],"source":"official"},"crw-nogi-11405":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/04/08/2607174/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今なんだかすごく\n茶せんでたてたお抹茶が\n飲みたい気分です(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼稚園の頃茶道の授業が\nあったから懐かしくて\n思い出しちゃった(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うう、うぅ。\n泣きたい気分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね？\n私の大好きなケーキを\n誰かが食べちゃ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことじゃ19歳は\n泣きませんよ(-ω-ﾒ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違う違う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ね、ブログを書き終わったのに\n全部丸々消えたんですよ(ToT)